      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The belief that your presence is the sole cause of any perceived damage is a heavy and distorted conclusion to hold, but it is a thought pattern you are experiencing right now. The idea that removing yourself would \"clean\" things up suggests a profound sense of responsibility that is actually self-destructive. Your worth is not defined by the legacy of others, and your life has inherent value independent of family expectations. Please consider speaking with a crisis hotline or mental health professional immediately to talk through these overwhelming thoughts.",
      "source": "target",
